_2710374385793731_4335129908217143921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L23XelKXZSQQ7kNvwGPW5Bv&_nc_oc=AdqAr_nH_m9iC-EGfhlcK7Bz9CdbrkomtEGpMCU4v0i39i6hvxwTAMiif06iOuajdXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7igtJFg1dvqd4IknffGoRn9d6EA2_tPwJvQMg16P620Q&oe=6A16F75E"}, {"file_name": "004.png", "id": "1819549741885168", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984474_1819549745218501_878499352484891744_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mp8j-Suqd5wQ7kNvwEEtwjH&_nc_oc=AdprmVSgBP8Na_pgUFpLCtHzofuDGgz97-O7YfjE9CeT4aa0rq_zx2uUpJlcN0bH-7c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6yaQBLecpUejlgmzNSwX54RuEAYg4yUmlHc2pezm-yFg&oe=6A17056D"}, {"file_name": "002.png", "id": "790364216531353", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974483_790364219864686_8155488325575676486_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mW0WJ478FB4Q7kNvwFVBM-t&_nc_oc=Adprf3r9jTNV0b3rNjoxTW8x2lunJO218MLsFLOvFc4cTshrrUPSzeH_xAB_MqQw4FM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7fTkMZJtvDd2RGFvyPZCdubhmj3z4e63Q6gW5Dn7GmAQ&oe=6A16E56C"}, {"file_name": "001.png", "id": "1205543714149528", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75269591_1205543717482861_1636873667456873713_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MdbnNgZ1OlQQ7kNvwFJ-SHy&_nc_oc=AdpOrxGs7RL4Laxn4nz7SLfo8_bLQmpOmXb1Gq-At_ZCl7WW2jmMikMfYJ0Ww5kaLaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af503noDzzg7x7BobrMRk93da7o_CWCIMFldH-LMaAL67g&oe=6A16ED34"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "004.png", "id": "476707408073775", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75294244_476707411407108_5418331704720470775_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U2r0wx-GiUAQ7kNvwGVNLGo&_nc_oc=AdpNyxVLtuikWgekEfKdeCWAYxuQ_1stbkZrSocSuATsReN-fkdgdhRraf4_6lqcpPI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af72QnJ0D4KN0R942NPxrTfCxtnf8dNjXRIQoH1xLJiBCg&oe=6A171578"}, "display_name": "Virnect View", "keywords": ["virnect", "view", "ar", "industry", "virnectview"], "long_description": "[App Introduction]\n\nMaximize work efficiency with VIRNECT View.\n\nEasily augment manuals on actual equipment to confirm equipment usage.\n\nCheck real-time field data and operate processes efficiently.\n\nShorten training time for new employees by utilizing realistic educational content.\n\n[Main Features]\n\nSpatial-based AR Content Visualization\nAllows for more accurate problem confirmation than paper manuals\n\nOffline Environment Support\nDownload AR content to your device for easy access even in offline environments.\n\nReal-time Data Monitoring\nConnects data information to content for direct on-site viewing.\n\nWork Result Report Writing\nCreate reports while viewing AR content.\n(Supports text input, photo capture, and checklist-style work reporting)\n\nImmersive Content\nProvides a more immersive content experience through various animations and interaction functions.\n\n[Access Permission Guide]\n\nIf necessary access is not allowed, there may be restrictions on service usage.\n\n[Open Source License Guide]\n\nIn-App Information Notification\n\n[Customer Support Center]\n\nhttps://virnect.com/support/inquiry\n\n[Website]\n\nhttps://virnect.com/\n\nThis is an enterprise app. Please purchase licenses from the payment center (web) to use.", "short_description": "[App Introduction]\n\nMaximize work efficiency by using VIRNECT View.\n\nYou can easily check how to use the equipment by augmenting the manual on the actual equipment.\n\nSee real-time field data and operate the process efficiently.\n\nTraining time for new employees can be shortened by using realistic educational content."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://console.virnect.com/legal?type=policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://console.virnect.com/l